        },
        {
          "text": "16 April, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1017,
          "end": 1031
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "2. Heard Mr. Rajesh More, learned counsel for the Applicant and Ms. Poonam Bhosale, learned APP for the y.s.patil 1 of 4 5-ABA-1018-2024.odt Respondent-State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1089,
      "end": 1248,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajesh More",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1102,
          "end": 1113
        },
        {
          "text": "Poonam Bhosale",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1157,
          "end": 1171
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "3. The FIR is lodged by Police Constable Ramesh Bhosale attached to Uruli Kanchan Police Station.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1248,
      "end": 1345,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramesh Bhosale",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1289,
          "end": 1303
        },
        {
          "text": "Uruli Kanchan Police Station",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1316,
          "end": 1344
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07307232171297073
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "He has stated that on 24/03/2024, at about 5.00 p.m. the Police Officers received an information that one pickup van bearing No. MH-12-UM-8331 was parked near the house of one Sandip Kanchan and there were banned articles for sale stored in that pickup van.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1346,
      "end": 1603,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "24/03/2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1368,
          "end": 1378
        },
        {
          "text": "Sandip Kanchan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1522,
          "end": 1536
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15442408621311188
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Police went there.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1604,
      "end": 1622,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2064012587070465
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The pickup can was seen on that spot.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1623,
      "end": 1660,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19366982579231262
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "The raid was conducted.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1661,
      "end": 1684,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25486063957214355
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The door of the pickup was opened and it was found that there were gunny bags and boxes containing pan masala, scented tobacco and gutkha worth Rs. 8,81,118/-.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1685,
      "end": 1844,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18745166063308716
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "The pickup van was belonging to the present Applicant Sameer Kanchan.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1845,
      "end": 1914,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sameer Kanchan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1899,
          "end": 1913
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2530158460140228
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "On this basis the FIR is lodged.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1915,
      "end": 1947,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23423020541667938
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "4. Learned counsel for the Applicant submitted that offence under section 328 of the I.P.C. is not made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1949,
      "end": 2057,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "section 328",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2015,
          "end": 2026
        },
        {
          "text": "I.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2034,
          "end": 2040
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24554376304149628
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The issue is pending before the Hon'ble Supreme Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2058,
      "end": 2112,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Supreme Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2098,
          "end": 2111
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22464458644390106
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "The contraband is already seized.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2113,
      "end": 2146,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30774378776550293
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Therefore, the custodial interrogation of the y.s.patil 2 of 4 5-ABA-1018-2024.odt Applicant is not necessary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2147,
      "end": 2257,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2716977298259735
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "5 Learned APP opposed these submissions and produced the police report dated 16/04/2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2259,
      "end": 2347,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "16/04/2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2336,
          "end": 2346
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1169324666261673
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "It is mentioned that the Applicant is a repeat offender.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2348,
      "end": 2404,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2126823365688324
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "There was another offence pending against him vide C.R. No. 94 of 2023 under the same sections for a similar offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2405,
      "end": 2522,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "C.R. No. 94 of 2023",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2456,
          "end": 2475
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18936704099178314
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "The pickup van was registered in his name in the RTO Office.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2523,
      "end": 2583,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "RTO Office",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2572,
          "end": 2582
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26563066244125366
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "There is direct connection of the present Applicant.\n6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2584,
      "end": 2639,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20247487723827362
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "I have considered these submissions.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2640,
      "end": 2676,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07667405903339386
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "The Applicant is a repeat offender.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2677,
      "end": 2712,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31952619552612305
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "This Court has taken a view that in such cases, the custodial interrogation of the seller of contraband articles is necessary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2713,
      "end": 2839,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27472782135009766
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "The said view is taken in the case of Mohammed Sadiq Adam Shaikh Vs. The State of Maharashtra in the order dated 30/1/2024 passed in ABA No. 207 of 2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PRE_RELIED",
      "start": 2840,
      "end": 2993,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Mohammed Sadiq Adam Shaikh Vs. The State of Maharashtra",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2878,
          "end": 2933
        },
        {
          "text": "30/1/2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2953,
          "end": 2962
        },
        {
          "text": "ABA No. 207 of 2024",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2973,
          "end": 2992
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.34089192748069763
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "I have perused the investigation papers produced by learned APP which contain the statements of raiding party members and the panchnama.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2994,
      "end": 3130,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1618923395872116
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "The statements and panchnama are consistent with the FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3131,
      "end": 3188,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23897436261177063
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "There is y.s.patil 3 of 4 5-ABA-1018-2024.odt strong material against the present Applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3189,
      "end": 3281,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2726597785949707
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "It is necessary to find out from where he had obtained those articles and how he wanted to sell those to the customers.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 3282,
      "end": 3401,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30992114543914795
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "The offence is serious.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3402,
      "end": 3425,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2703797221183777
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "The Applicant's custodial interrogation is necessary.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3426,
      "end": 3479,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30077502131462097
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "He cannot be protected under section 438 of Cr.P.C.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3480,
      "end": 3531,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "section 438",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3509,
          "end": 3520
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3524,
          "end": 3531
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.560189425945282
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "The Application is rejected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3532,
      "end": 3560,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24572600424289703
    },
